WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: In Labels, choose Add label template or edit through a template’s menu.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Choose its category, name and company-approved timing rules.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3: Add fields on the canvas, move or resize them and edit their properties. Use Done for a field and Save for the template.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 4: Configure the printer/media resolution and test a preview before normal printing.
